comments.body:
@jakevdp 

Dear Sir,

I ended up doing almost exactly as you describe. In fact, I would suggest promoting the awareness of the notion of `transfer_guard('disallow')` because it improved runtime of my experiments by something like 2-3 times. This is closest to have strong types on one's data in the sense of not allowing silent transfers.

